# rpg_vikit from GitHub), so keep the build context empty -- don't send the whole
# FAST-LIVO2 C++ source to the docker daemon. FAST-LIVO2 is built at runtime via
# catkin_make against the bind-mounted repo, not baked into the image.
*
!Dockerfile
